==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[White Wind]] (25%) spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] (25%) spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] (25%) spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[White Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[White Wind]]s (25%) spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[White Wind]]s (25%) spawn, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage, even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemy serves practically no threat at all.

